{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9688ba01-7f6d-52cb-8a29-30317d1d6313", "source_ordinal": 788, "reading_ordinal": 3269, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "平乱", "published_at": "2025-05-13T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/0101a6c229c411f085c052540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "第一步，公司高层集体道歉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为能出现这种事故，必然是因为下情上传或上情下达的制度设计出现了重大漏洞，以至于下层产生的问题未能被及早察觉和处理。事情要发展到这一步才能被我们察觉，这个直接上司有多大问题都是次要问题，我们自己有多大问题才是首要问题。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 123}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我们必然会做章程上、制度上的修订来减少这类情况再次发生的概率。", "char_start": 124, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "其实这就是组织成员真正需要的“安抚”——不是加薪、不是补偿、不是帮忙泄愤，而是一种对某个明显威胁的有效应对。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "仅仅只是搞情绪贿赂、物质贿赂，拿中层献祭，其实不但侮辱了一线员工的志气和品格，诱发勒索行为倾向，还会导致中层离心离德。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "万方有罪，罪在朕躬——企业里没有决策层无需道歉的过失。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "即使是所谓“执行层的过失”，这人也是根据高层制定的招聘规则招募的、由高层直接或授权批准的，高层一样要承担责任，绝没有“都是这个人使坏”就可以搪塞过去的理由。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 377}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "如果有任何“无需道歉的过失”可言，那么意味着那件事超出了人类所能管理的极限，无法通过成本可承受的手段加以防范，其性质就必然不是一个过失，而仅仅是一个意外事故。", "char_start": 378, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "只要是一个事前可以预料存在相当概率，而事后又证明可以通过政策调整降低概率的损失，对高层就没有借口，只能认定为“过失”并承担责任。", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 522}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "高层先承担责任，才能通过这种公正性的证明获得裁决其他组织成员之间矛盾的道义立场。", "char_start": 523, "char_end": 563}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "否则，高层明显的先推卸了自己的责任，这就意味着不论接下来谁受到处理，谁都先做了高层的替罪羊，都必然要引起兔死狐悲的涟漪效应，进而造成“及时行乐”“早为退步计”的组织腐化。", "char_start": 564, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "其实具体的过失永远是一时一地的小事，只考虑“摆平”，随便都有一百多种办法，决定具体用哪种办法的真正关键，对高层而言，其实是对长尾效应的深谋远虑。", "char_start": 650, "char_end": 722}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "如果借助一次矛盾爆发，能传递出“高层奉行无条件对一切过失负首要责任的原则”这种信息，那么很自然的就会为企业注入根本的严肃性。", "char_start": 723, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为任何过失行为，包括哪怕一个流水线工人乱拧螺丝钉，CEO都要道歉、都要承担赔偿责任，那么从上到下都不必对“x层才不会在意这种事”有任何幻想。", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "如果有什么事处理了之后所有的损失都触及到某个层级就为止了，那么无论你怎么强调敬业、负责，人们也会本能的、自然的认定没有被触及的那些层级根本不会有根本的关切，只不过做做样子而已。", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 946}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这才是“出了事全拿中层献祭”对底层其实仅仅只是一种贿赂和收买，而根本达不到激励底层的作用的原因。", "char_start": 947, "char_end": 995}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "甚至可以这么说——你是这底层之一，你们起事之后高层出来收拾局面，如果这个收拾没有包含高层的主动引咎认罚，那么即使开出的安抚条件相当优厚（那是股东的钱），也没有在事后追究你的责任，你也应该及早考虑跳槽、辞职的选择。", "char_start": 996, "char_end": 1102}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这种企业对你而言缺少职业发展的保障，因为接下来你无非是升任中层，而中层的首要基本职能是干脏活的替罪羊。", "char_start": 1103, "char_end": 1154}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "第二步，成立调查小组，听取所有各方的报告，还原事情经过，确定公司当前管理制度的漏洞。", "char_start": 1156, "char_end": 1198}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "公司制度当然不可能阻止所有人违规操作，尤其是串通性质的违规操作，但是这不表示公司制度不应该尽早的、及时的察觉异常。如果没有，显然意味着监察机制的不足——例如对举报人缺少有力的保护措施。", "char_start": 1199, "char_end": 1291}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "听取报告的重点不是去考虑“公司的损失应该谁来赔偿”，而是如何在制度上给全体成员一个“以后这类情况再出现的概率会降低”的回应。", "char_start": 1292, "char_end": 1354}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "切忌搞成“枭首示众”“以平民愤”这类煽情式的局面。", "char_start": 1355, "char_end": 1380}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "相反，除非的确查到中层管理有恶意违规行为，否则如果只是普通的能力上的无能、风格上不能适应企业文化，甚至纯属“八字不合，命格犯冲”这类无奈的冲突，当事管理层要享受应有的礼遇。", "char_start": 1381, "char_end": 1467}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "那不是ta的个人责任，而是公司自己用人不明、识人有误。不但这位管理人员不应受辱，反而公司要对其抱有一定的歉意——因为错误的傲慢，我们耽误了你一段事业生涯的宝贵时光。", "char_start": 1468, "char_end": 1550}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "遇到有恶意违规，那就应该怎么走程序就怎么走程序，该追究法律责任的追究法律责任。", "char_start": 1551, "char_end": 1590}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "但没有恶意违规，公司应该循正常待遇解除合作关系，该给的离职补偿一分不应该少，而且在推荐信上不应留下恶评。", "char_start": 1591, "char_end": 1643}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "哪怕基层员工“民愤极大”也如此。", "char_start": 1644, "char_end": 1660}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "因为中层管理天然要遭遇这类“民愤”，绝不能无原则的唯“民愤”是瞻，动辄牺牲中层管理，“借粮官头”去安抚、哄骗“民意”。", "char_start": 1661, "char_end": 1720}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "如果高层对中层管理没有这点担当，一味的“亲民”，用中层管理做“耗材”投喂底层情绪，企业会面临生死存亡的危局。", "char_start": 1721, "char_end": 1775}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "一来，这种无原则的出卖会极大的刺激基层的暴虐冲动，令所有中层寸步难移；", "char_start": 1776, "char_end": 1811}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "二来，这会导致中层骨干离心离德、破罐子破摔。一方面能力强的大批离职另寻安身之所，另一方面因为人才出走，剩下的庸才反而会变得举足轻重、尾大不掉，对企业的组织生态造成全局性的恶化；", "char_start": 1812, "char_end": 1900}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "三来，这会导致基层员工寻求升职的动力大幅减弱。“宁为鸡首，不为牛后”——最高只想当“兵王”，无人想当哪怕一个排长。而这种上升渠道的崩断对企业的总体发展有极为深远的危害。", "char_start": 1901, "char_end": 1985}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "而如果反过来做——高层道歉、制度改进、外加对基层受损者给予相当补偿，其实安抚性已经足够。而对中层的就事论事、领袖分谤的爱护，也足以令整个中层保持信心，甚至增强对组织的向心力。而制度的严格化和“礼送出境”的处置，也可以震慑某些人继续利用职权谋私的妄念，不会给中层以过强的安全感，避免恃宠而骄。", "char_start": 1986, "char_end": 2131}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这种对中层骨干的爱惜和礼遇，还会起到“千金买马骨”的激励效应，驱动基层员工努力上进，并降低外部人才的空降引进的门槛。", "char_start": 2132, "char_end": 2190}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "真正震慑住中层不妄动的，其实恰恰是基层的跃跃欲试和外部人才的向往——也就是那句无言的“你不干有的是人要干”——而不是所谓的“剥皮揎草、千刀万剐”。", "char_start": 2191, "char_end": 2264}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "而这一切要行得通，起步第一条，就是组织领袖要有“万方有罪，罪在朕躬”的不可动摇的自觉。", "char_start": 2265, "char_end": 2308}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "企业是你的，企业出现的一切问题，包括任何人的违规、违法操作，你都有不可推卸的责任。", "char_start": 2309, "char_end": 2350}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "你第一时间先把自己的责任担了，你的领袖地位才会实际生效，你才从自然法中再次获得处置任何事态的天然权威。", "char_start": 2351, "char_end": 2402}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "问题才有寻求妥善解的余地可言。", "char_start": 2403, "char_end": 2418}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "一旦你玩弄公器，利用自己的裁决权把你自己应分的损失、责任推向任何替罪羊，你的道德力量即刻消解，你能寻求的最好结果也只是一个“苟且解”。", "char_start": 2419, "char_end": 2486}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "“妥善解”能让你的组织越挫越强，负重断裂的肌肉纤维重新修复只会更胜从前。将来你会发现，这点痛苦和折磨相对你所获得的力量而言，实在是最划算的投资。", "char_start": 2487, "char_end": 2559}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "而“苟且解”则会不断推高你企业内部的残毒指标，渐渐让一切机能走向循环恶化，直至万劫不复。", "char_start": 2560, "char_end": 2604}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "向死则生，苟生则死。", "char_start": 2605, "char_end": 2615}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "自己多想想吧。", "char_start": 2616, "char_end": 2623}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 45}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0471"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果你是老板，被十几位员工联名要求罢免掉他们的直接上司，不然全辞职，你会怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044"], "summary": "围绕“平乱”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“第一步，公司高层集体道歉。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "第一步，公司高层集体道歉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "844bc111-f9e9-5d9f-9a1d-8148ec188835", "source_ordinal": 787, "reading_ordinal": 3270, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "雅达", "published_at": "2025-05-14T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/a61fb8662aa911f0bf2652540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有这么几个东西，建议你养成习惯，当成精神零食去吃。没事时不时就看看：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）《说文解字》。遇到汉字，查一查说文解字。", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "2）《辞源》。遇到词汇、短语，查一查辞源。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "3）《培根词汇》。这是个app，约等于英语辞源，绝大多数英语词汇，都可以帮你追根溯源，从词根、前后缀拆解到形式变迁一览无余。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "用词精准，其实总是从辞源开始，要知道这些词汇的“出身”、源流。尽管这些出身很多人都不清楚，但实际上这些词的用法和这段历史有深刻的内在联系，恰恰是这个联系才决定了近义词之间的差别到底是什么，决定了“为什么此处该用A而不用B”的问题。", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "语言是演化出来的，词汇就像动物物种，带鱼也许看上去像鳗鱼，但带鱼肉和鳗鱼肉有巨大的差异，完全不是一个味道。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "鸡蛋和鸭蛋更相似，但没人用鸭蛋做蛋炒饭。", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "遣词造句正如做菜，仅仅看到形似是不够的，这个食材是从什么源头来的，才是它们品性差异的要害。这背后的故事你知道得越深，这个食材你自然用得越好。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 404}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "4）《古文观止》。这个能背就尽量背一背——尤其是那些被中学课文收录的篇章，那是最好背会。", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为这些内容就是那些“食材”最早做出来的“菜”，而且还是顶级的好菜。这极大的有利于你掌握汉语的语感。", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 500}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "汉语是天然的诗赋语言，有天然的节律性、音乐性。这个在古文中的体现远胜今文。最好的学习方法，就是背诵经典古文。", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "天天吃好的，你自然知道什么是好的，等你做的时候就算你厨艺不咋地，你至少也知道你差在哪、该往哪边改。", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 605}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "久而久之，达意、精准自然就能做到。", "char_start": 606, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而且你还会意识到其实真正要达的“意”不是时间、地点、金额、参会人员、验收标准、合同条款……这些技术性细节，而是感情、立场、态度。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 688}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "技术性细节相同的请帖，你写错的并不是那些要点，而是感情。", "char_start": 689, "char_end": 717}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "去做吧，做了就会好起来。", "char_start": 718, "char_end": 730}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0471"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：词不达意，用词不精确该怎么去提升？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“雅达”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有这么几个东西，建议你养成习惯，当成精神零食去吃。没事时不时就看看：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有这么几个东西，建议你养成习惯，当成精神零食去吃。没事时不时就看看：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "cc1af6bd-dd4d-500d-ab5f-11401032f261", "source_ordinal": 786, "reading_ordinal": 3271, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "紫气东来", "published_at": "2025-05-15T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/9099f7f82b7711f0877752540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人们一直在问“为什么胖东来不全国开店”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "其实根本原因就在这里。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "创始人性格上的特性，会限制住其领导的实体规模和寿命上限。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "quote", "index": 4, "text": "上尝从容与信言诸将能不，各有差。上问曰：“如我能将几何？”信曰：“陛下不过能将十万。”上曰：“于君何如？”曰：“臣多多而益善耳。”", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这句“多多益善”是句非常有魄力的话。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一般人都有上限，所以要知其度，要适可而止，此所谓“人贵有自知之明”。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但有一类人没有上限，此所谓“帝王之姿”，可以无限扩大组织规模，直到“普天之下，莫非王臣”，坐北朝南，可称天子。", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这两类人有一个最显著的差别，就是对特定刺激的反应的尺度不同。", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "简单来说，对越高频、成本越低、越局部的刺激反应越小，其组织管理能力的上限越高。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这道理非常直白——如果风吹草动就如临大敌，有限的资源就会迅速被绷紧、耗竭，自然也就会停止扩张了。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 357}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "有苍蝇叮，牛只能用摇头、皮肤抽动、甩尾巴这种成本的策略去应对，而不能用撞树、翻滚的方式去赶苍蝇。", "char_start": 358, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "尽管这些策略同样可以赶走苍蝇，而且看上去比甩尾巴更有威力、更“彻底”，但实际上这么做就算把苍蝇赶走也输了。", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 460}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "因为亏损也是失败。", "char_start": 461, "char_end": 470}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这也是人为什么要学习各种处世技能、经营智慧——这就是为了提高处理问题的效率，不但要解决问题，还要以相称的成本规模和风险规模来解决问题。", "char_start": 471, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "对方用机枪兵骚扰，你用两辆坦克解决，解决了你也输了。你只有用比机枪兵更廉价的手段解决掉这机枪兵，你才是真的赢了。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "能以比挑衅的发起者更低的成本解决挑衅，才能真正的遏制、震慑乃至提前打掉对方挑衅的企图。而要做到这一点，需要大量的修炼和学习。", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "能用一根绣花针打败一杆红缨枪，你自然东方不败。", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 682}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "当你需要用红缨枪去打败绣花针，那么你的极限也就不远了。", "char_start": 683, "char_end": 710}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这也是为什么对很多过于细小的、危害不大的问题，这些人直接予以忽略。", "char_start": 711, "char_end": 744}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这是做大事在数学上肉眼可见的绝对必要条件。", "char_start": 745, "char_end": 766}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你什么时候遇上了自己既无法遏止，又无法经济的解决的困难，哪怕它并不致命，也会导致规模扩张的动能受限。", "char_start": 767, "char_end": 817}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "举点例子，帝国幅员辽阔，最多能辽阔到什么程度呢？就是在帝国的最边疆发生了随机叛乱——这个总是会有的——那么当地的税赋要能支撑派军征讨的成本。", "char_start": 818, "char_end": 888}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "其实你打还是打得过的，但是你次次都要派禁卫军去打，光高铁票和装备快递费都亏得不行了。", "char_start": 889, "char_end": 931}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你的帝国就肯定不如动员当地驻军就能打赢的帝国大。", "char_start": 932, "char_end": 956}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "更不如那些一旦有人叛了，周边的邻邦还不等你动手就主动帮你把这人绑了送进京城以求封赏的帝国大。", "char_start": 957, "char_end": 1003}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "更不如那些一旦有人起了叛心，告诉朋友，朋友就一致怒斥其“贪私利而祸天下”而与其绝交的帝国大。", "char_start": 1004, "char_end": 1050}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "注意看这层层递进——最后一层能做到“进一步扩张的边际成本为零”。", "char_start": 1051, "char_end": 1083}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这就是能做到“多多益善”的人的数学特性——ta们做事指向努力构造一个“扩张边际成本为零”的架构。", "char_start": 1084, "char_end": 1132}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "要达成这个架构，是需要多年的艰辛努力的，要建立必要的组织结构、积攒足够的规则体系、积淀足够的组织共识、构建足够的意识形态资产。", "char_start": 1133, "char_end": 1196}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "但一旦构建成功，达到了“进一步扩张规模边际成本为零”的成就，这个组织就会在规模上突破人力管理的上限，达到数千万乃至数十亿成员的规模。", "char_start": 1197, "char_end": 1263}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这就是“天下唯有德者居之”的实践性解释。", "char_start": 1264, "char_end": 1284}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "这不是指“当个大孝子”“当个老好人”，而是指对“扩张边际成本”这个关键指标的宗教性的虔诚和追求。", "char_start": 1285, "char_end": 1333}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "真正明白这个要害的人，会为了这个指标克服自身一切的软弱和傲慢，有什么问题就承认什么问题，该做什么悔改就做什么悔改。", "char_start": 1334, "char_end": 1391}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "类似这类“按捺不住情绪用大炮打蚊子”的行为，对这类人来说是那种极为刺眼的错误。因为“大炮打蚊子”是显而易见的直接提高“扩张边际成本”的行为，是绝对不可选的。", "char_start": 1392, "char_end": 1470}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "如果需要克服自身情绪才可以不犯这个错误，这类人会毫不犹豫的克制自身的情绪。", "char_start": 1471, "char_end": 1508}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "这是真正通向山巅的漫长道路，是胸怀大志的人必须有的自觉。", "char_start": 1509, "char_end": 1537}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "你们之中将来必会兴起这样的人——就从看懂这篇东西开始。", "char_start": 1538, "char_end": 1565}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36, "quote": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0471"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待胖东来关闭官网事件？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037"], "summary": "围绕“紫气东来”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人们一直在问“为什么胖东来不全国开店”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人们一直在问“为什么胖东来不全国开店”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "00712edd-0b2e-51d3-9099-33aeeb0377cf", "source_ordinal": 785, "reading_ordinal": 3272, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "父去子留", "published_at": "2025-05-15T13:51:42.038000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1897070516210210540/answer/1904939378020688498"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "去父留子不是一种“生育观”，而是一种人生对策。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "哪里是“去父”？", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "是父自己不留，留如不留，甚至留不如不留，好吗？", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "是留不住、留不了、留不得，好吗？", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "留无可留，若之奈何？", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "真是人不想留，不愿留吗？", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个世界上至少一半的逐客令其实是被下逐客令的那一方签发的，发出的那一方其实只是回天无力的邮递员罢了。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "父已自去，所谓“去父”，只不过是最后的倔强而已，这根本不是一个容人选择的问题。", "char_start": 149, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "唯一的问题只是留不留子。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 201}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "难道不留子？", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "难道不留？", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "不留子？", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你让女性怎么办？", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "海誓山盟不可信，法律保障不可靠，抚养责任不可指望，随手一搜多的是隐藏、拖欠的小妙招、大军师和热情的“逃友”。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你让女性怎么办？", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "她不去面对“父去子留”的现实可能，不预先下定决心接受“即使如此也要结婚，也要生育”的残酷预期，她还有什么办法？", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你们谁来给她第二条路？", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "谁来？", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你们一个个摇唇鼓舌、捶胸顿足、赌咒发誓，真的发生了呢？", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "法律保护你离婚的自由，“智囊”们帮你们躲避义务，兄弟们高声夸你精明，网友们还帮你骂“贪心不足的疯婆娘”。", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "她能怎么办？是找法院来强制执行你早已清空废止的工资卡，还是没收你早已转移到公司名下的房产车辆？她一介女子，如何在抚养子女之余再挤出薪水来寻找神通广大的私家侦探查找你的实控账户？", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 534}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "她能指望谁来发动舆论压力、道德谴责？别的“疯婆娘”？", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "或者我这种“吃利女流量的黑心自媒体”？", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 581}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你这不是已经准备好了帽子，打好了预防针，“免疫”了吗？", "char_start": 582, "char_end": 609}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "她什么都没有。", "char_start": 611, "char_end": 618}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "她要再不靠“大不了去父留子”来自我安抚，要从绝望中搜罗一点勇气，她要怎么选择？", "char_start": 619, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "彻底放弃结婚生子的打算吗？", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 672}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "heading", "index": 28, "text": "你是非要她绝望，非要连这一点绝望中的象征性反抗也要弄脏、践踏吗？", "char_start": 673, "char_end": 705}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 707, "char_end": 711}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "因为你相信把这点“不良思想”也扑灭，让这些“疯婆娘”别再“妄想”，你就可以更容易得到你们想要的？", "char_start": 712, "char_end": 760}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这么说吧，如果你这么不在乎女人到底怎么想，你不如还是养条狗吧。", "char_start": 761, "char_end": 792}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "相信我，你对狗都比这好。", "char_start": 793, "char_end": 805}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "何必假装你“关心”“在乎”，枉生冤孽？", "char_start": 806, "char_end": 825}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "女人倒也罢了——那是做好了心理准备的。", "char_start": 826, "char_end": 845}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "关键孩子可怜。", "char_start": 846, "char_end": 853}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0471"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么少数年轻女孩开始宣传【去父留子】的生育观？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035"], "summary": "围绕“父去子留”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“去父留子不是一种“生育观”，而是一种人生对策。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "去父留子不是一种“生育观”，而是一种人生对策。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "eb04a823-a549-5544-b907-f47eba4bdf28", "source_ordinal": 784, "reading_ordinal": 3273, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无定锚", "published_at": "2025-05-15T15:18:04.059000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1905550880117334892/answer/1906126252282196958"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有两种营销文化。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一种是Under Statement，一种是 Over Statement。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "Over statement 是指我广告做得很大，听起来非常诱人，从宣传上制造巨大的势差，从而推动成交。而成交之后用户会发觉被直接宣传的卖点确实突出，和理想效果相比有一定差距，但这差距没有大到构成欺骗（即可以发起诉讼）的程度。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而没有被直接宣传的产品的其他侧面，多少有点不尽如人意，但又没有差到足以追究质量问题的程度。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而under statement，是指营销卖点完全符合用户预期，甚至会超过用户预期。而那些营销外细节，常常额外给用户惊喜。但因为是under statement，往往没有巨大的宣传势差，难以形成巨大的购买冲动。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "over statement路线是中国非常流行的营销哲学，某种意义上讲，甚至可以说是中国的大部分企业而言，所谓的“营销”几乎就是如何在确保安全的前提下做尽可能巧妙的over statement。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 411}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一系列经典的营销案例，例如“比硬币还薄”“开车都睡着了”“想撞都难”……都是这个策略的经典应用。", "char_start": 412, "char_end": 460}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这个做法可以获得巨大的成交量，而靠着“超高性价比”和揪不住破绽的话术，足以保证反噬效应可控。", "char_start": 461, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "因此它基本成了中国企业营销文化的圣经。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 527}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "问题是，这本灰色圣经无法支撑豪华品牌。", "char_start": 528, "char_end": 547}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为豪华品牌必须要走under statement路线。", "char_start": 548, "char_end": 576}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "我宣传的卖点，你一体验上不但要觉得名不虚传，还要进一步的觉得有非要亲身用上才能体会的宣传所不及的妙处。", "char_start": 577, "char_end": 628}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "我没宣传的细节，你只要拿来和同级别产品比较，一定在品质上无可挑剔，甚至背面都镀了金。你看不见的地方，一定比你预期的更精致和更周到。", "char_start": 629, "char_end": 694}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "只有用户用了之后产生“这个产品的核心卖点比宣传的还要好，而且凡看不到的细节品质必定不必担心”，觉得这个产品的宣传——尽管已经相当诱人——仍然没有完整的表达出产品的绝妙和“不欺暗室”的优质，这个品牌的豪华感才能成立。", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 802}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这是豪华品牌必须摆出来的格调，必须有的矜持。", "char_start": 803, "char_end": 825}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这个矜持说白了，就是对“我不需要靠over statement争取那份额外的销量”的近乎傲慢的信念。", "char_start": 826, "char_end": 876}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我懒得多说，如果你用了我的东西体会不到它的好处，我就认定你这人是劣质客户，我是不会苦口婆心说服你、求你相信我有多好的。", "char_start": 877, "char_end": 936}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这就是豪华品牌必须抱有的自觉，绝没有绕过的可能。", "char_start": 937, "char_end": 961}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "现在问题来了——某些商品，必须是豪华品牌。", "char_start": 962, "char_end": 983}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "就是那些事关生命安全、事关客户个人品牌的产品。", "char_start": 984, "char_end": 1007}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "例如汽车、心脏支架、登山安全绳、晚礼服。", "char_start": 1008, "char_end": 1028}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这些东西要命或者关系到我个人的品牌定位，你就不能让我觉得里面有over statement的风险。", "char_start": 1029, "char_end": 1078}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这不是说你必须卖得很贵或者必须很高档，你可以卖中档甚至低档型号，但是你必须不能是over statement。", "char_start": 1079, "char_end": 1134}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "比如国产心脏支架，你不能来个宣传参数其实达不到，然后来辩解“我这下面有一行小字”“我这毕竟便宜”。", "char_start": 1135, "char_end": 1184}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "比如高端品牌规格标1000，卖价10000，你参数标600，卖价3000。但你一定要让我实际使用时遇到的最差表现都要高于600，而不是“技术上讲，这也不能算没到600，再说我这不是便宜吗”。", "char_start": 1185, "char_end": 1280}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这样你可以摆脱法律诉讼，但你很可能会被客户集体踢出采购范围。", "char_start": 1281, "char_end": 1311}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "小米现在就是卡在这个点上——它的整个企业文化从灵魂深处对over statement有自上而下、由内及外的崇拜和迷信。以至于就算它的显意识里非常清晰明确的知道“做汽车我得换一个方式”——我相信小米，尤其是雷军，不可能没有这个觉悟——但在内心各种防不胜防的隐秘处、曲折处，总有一种“这不能算over statement”的心照不宣的、无意识合谋的侥幸。", "char_start": 1312, "char_end": 1487}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "下面提案的时候，知道不能over statement，提的就是以下面人的认知而言最under statement的提案。", "char_start": 1488, "char_end": 1548}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "上面审核的时候，也知道不能over statement，选的也已经是一堆提案中最不over statement的提案。", "char_start": 1549, "char_end": 1608}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "大家在感叹“自打我们开门以来，我们从没有这么保守过”。", "char_start": 1609, "char_end": 1636}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "而就是这样一种从上到下都为自己“自我革命”的勇气都有些小感动的史无前例的最under statement的宣传方案，在事实面前仍然撞得粉身碎骨。", "char_start": 1637, "char_end": 1709}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "这就像一个人，竭尽全力洗心革面，已经感觉自我委屈、自我革命到了极点，满心觉得自己交出的答卷已经完全改过自新了，却被宣判“还是不老实”。", "char_start": 1710, "char_end": 1777}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "瞬间被卡死了。", "char_start": 1778, "char_end": 1785}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "不是不想改，而是“如果我根本没法判断我到底改没改掉，我怎么改？”", "char_start": 1786, "char_end": 1818}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "它现在对“如果我重新组织一个营销提案，我怎么知道这一次的提案就没有内含隐患”这个问题产生了根本性的自我怀疑。", "char_start": 1819, "char_end": 1873}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "它在怀疑自己的高管的判断力。", "char_start": 1874, "char_end": 1888}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "或者更深刻的讲——雷军作为最高领导人、最后掌舵者，在怀疑自己的判断力。", "char_start": 1889, "char_end": 1924}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "我上次觉得这个方案不会有问题，但是出了问题。", "char_start": 1925, "char_end": 1947}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "下次重拟方案，我当然会改到我觉得没有问题才放行。问题是，这次我觉得没有问题，是不是真的就没有问题？", "char_start": 1948, "char_end": 1997}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "如果这次再出问题，小米汽车，乃至整个小米集团要面临生死大劫。", "char_start": 1998, "char_end": 2028}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "我还能不能相信我自己的判断力？", "char_start": 2029, "char_end": 2044}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "我如果不相信我自己的判断力，如果我引入“外脑”，并且外脑和我的意见不同时我以外脑的意见为准，那么事实上领导小米的就将是这外脑，而不是我了。", "char_start": 2045, "char_end": 2114}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "这甚至不如直接退休，因为真这么干，我只是当了外脑的替罪羊。", "char_start": 2115, "char_end": 2144}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "然而我能退休吗？没有雷军的小米，还成其为小米吗？没了雷军的小米，在投资人眼里还值这个估值吗？", "char_start": 2145, "char_end": 2191}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "他进退两难。", "char_start": 2192, "char_end": 2198}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "这才是小米现在完全沉默的原因。", "char_start": 2199, "char_end": 2214}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "触及灵魂的自问，是一个关于“什么是可信的”“什么是对的”的底层认识论问题。", "char_start": 2215, "char_end": 2252}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "雷军一直以来的自信，都是靠自己具体成绩的成功来做定锚的，这是成功者——或曰幸运儿——的通病。", "char_start": 2253, "char_end": 2299}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "事实上人的自信不能以自己的成绩为定锚，因为这种定锚是可以被成绩本身的否定拔起的。", "char_start": 2300, "char_end": 2340}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "真正的认知定锚必须建基在永不动摇、无视一切无常的主观认定上。", "char_start": 2341, "char_end": 2371}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "三四个月，要找到这个真岩底，他需要好运。", "char_start": 2372, "char_end": 2392}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 51}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0471"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：小米汽车好像一夜塌房了，是行业针对还是技术真的不行？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051"], "summary": "围绕“无定锚”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有两种营销文化。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有两种营销文化。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "67b1f4b7-13d9-5959-9222-a59e84e9e9d9", "source_ordinal": 783, "reading_ordinal": 3274, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "萝卜永动机", "published_at": "2025-05-16T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/dd1e9d702c3c11f09f2552540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你想要人们去做什么事，最好的手段从来就不是去讲这个事怎么怎么该做、做了如何如何好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人并不是一种“渴望做该做的事”的动物，你还没从自己身上发现这一点吗？", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 76}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "人爱做、想做的是自己做得成的事。", "char_start": 77, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "流水线上的工人们为什么“不愿意学习”？", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 113}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为学习对ta们而言一直都是负面体验——学过，甚至是反复的学过，但是体验总是“学完一圈后除了无穷的挫折感和疲劳感，什么也没学会”。", "char_start": 114, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "从开始到结束，每一步都充满挫折、疲劳，并且总是一无所获。而且是一门又一门、一次又一次，结论都一样。", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "总是一无所得还千辛万苦，怎么“愿意”？", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 249}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你把学习说得再重要，我折腾一轮之后还是一无所得加千辛万苦，我怎么听？", "char_start": 250, "char_end": 284}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "学习本身需要学习，不会学习，就不会想学习。", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果你真的希望引导工人们学习，你要做的不是去斥责ta们不好学，或者告诫ta们学习有多重要，而是告诉ta们——“谁能学会用这个机器，日薪加200”“谁能做到这个工艺，可以当工长，搬到干部楼”。", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不要提“学一门技术”，直接设立奖金激励ta们竞争就可以了。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "大多数人都只能基于眼前的最近的利益驱动行事，追逐着眼前的胡萝卜前进。", "char_start": 433, "char_end": 467}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "能仅仅凭着理性的判断就选择一门系统的知识，然后去进行有计划的学习，这是对“学习”这门技术本身有深厚的功力的人才能办到的行为艺术。", "char_start": 468, "char_end": 532}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "能做到这一点的人，基本都会在不久的将来触及自己所在领域的顶点，有机会突破人类知识和经验的边界。", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但这是要靠运气的，暂时做不到也不必苛求自己，更不必说以你自己并不高明多少的水平去嘲笑别人了。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 627}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "各自追求好自己眼前的胡萝卜就好了，胡萝卜已经很好吃了。", "char_start": 628, "char_end": 655}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0471"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么工厂流水线的工人们宁愿每天做重覆的工作也不愿意去学一门技术？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“萝卜永动机”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你想要人们去做什么事，最好的手段从来就不是去讲这个事怎么怎么该做、做了如何如何好。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你想要人们去做什么事，最好的手段从来就不是去讲这个事怎么怎么该做、做了如何如何好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 41, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
